# Recharts Plugin

Beautiful, responsive charts and visualizations with Recharts.

## Files Added

- `src/components/ui/charts/examples.tsx` — Pre-built chart components (line, bar, pie)
- `docs/recharts.md` — Complete documentation

## Included Charts

- **Line Chart** — Trends and time-series data
- **Bar Chart** — Category comparisons
- **Pie Chart** — Proportions and distributions

## Quick Example

```tsx
import { LineChartExample } from "@/components/ui/charts/examples";

<LineChartExample />
```

## Features

✓ Fully responsive  
✓ Dark mode support  
✓ Tooltips and legends  
✓ TypeScript support  
✓ Copy-paste examples  
✓ Accessible charts

See `docs/recharts.md` for complete guide.
